# hosted_runner_orgs.txt — GitHub orgs whose repos may keep GitHub-HOSTED
# runners (CRITICAL RULE 9 / AI_RULES §21): their hosted minutes are paid for.
# Every other repo runs CI on the local self-hosted runner.
# Copy to config/hosted_runner_orgs.txt (a repo checkout) or, for an npm
# install, to ~/.myai/hosted_runner_orgs.txt (survives upgrades), and list one
# org per line (case-insensitive; blank lines and # comments are ignored).
# Empty = none. Read by scripts/lib/selfhosted_runner.sh: $SELFHOSTED_EXEMPT_ORG
# overrides, then the install-root config/ file, then the ~/.myai one.
#
# my-company-org
